 "text": "..title\nA resolution authorizing The Metropolitan Government of Nashville and Davidson County to accept new public sanitary sewer main and sanitary sewer manhole, for two properties located at 1204 A and 1204 B North 7th Street (MWS Project No. 26-SL-108 and Proposal No. 2026M-072ES-001).\n..body\nWHEREAS, the acceptance of approximately 64 linear feet of new eight-inch sanitary sewer main (DIP) and one sanitary sewer manhole, for two properties located at 1204 A and 1204 B North 7th Street, is needed to construct project number 26-SL-108; and,\nWHEREAS, BL2024-345 authorizes the Metropolitan Department of Water and Sewerage Services to approve extensions, additions, improvement, or works by resolution of the Metropolitan Council; and,\nWHEREAS, the Metropolitan Planning Commission approved mandatory referral No. 2026M072ES-001 on August 17, 2026, for the acceptance of said sanitary sewer main and sanitary sewer manhole.\nNOW, THEREFORE, BE IT RESOLVED BY THE COUNCIL OF THE METROPOLITAN GOVERNMENT OF NASHVILLE AND DAVIDSON COUNTY:\nSection 1.\tThe Metropolitan Government of Nashville and Davidson County is authorized to accept approximately 64 linear feet of new eight-inch sanitary sewer main (DIP) and one sanitary sewer manhole, for two properties located at 1204 A and 1204 B North 7th Street, as shown on Exhibit 1, which is attached hereto and incorporated by reference.\nMap & Parcel: \t\t\t\tAddress:\n07116043700\t\t\t\t\t1204 A North 7th Street\n07116043800\t\t\t\t\t1204 B North 7th Street\nSection 2.\tThe Directors of Water and Sewerage Services and Public Property Administration are authorized to execute such documents as may be necessary and appropriate to carry out the acceptance authorized by this resolution. \nSection 3.\tThis resolution shall take effect from and after its final passage, the welfare of The Metropolitan Government of Nashville and Davidson County requiring it. \n..Agenda Analysis\nAnalysis\n\nThis resolution accepts approximately 64 linear feet of new eight-inch sanitary sewer main (DIP) and one sanitary sewer manhole, for two properties located at 1204 A and 1204 B North 7th Street.\n\nTennessee Code Annotated section 7-35-406(A)(2) and Ordinance No. BL2024-345 allow the Metropolitan Department of Water and Sewerage Services to approve extension, additions, or works by resolution of the Metropolitan Council. \n\nThis resolution has been approved by the Planning Commission.\n\n"
}
